1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,900
One bowl passes through 72 hands.
一只碗，过手七十二

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,200
Seventy-two steps before it's a bowl.
七十二道工序，才成器

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,500
This is Jingdezhen — China's porcelain capital.
这是景德镇，中国瓷都

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,800
One town, one craft, a thousand years.
一座城，一千年，只做瓷

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,100
Clay, throwing, painting, glazing, fire.
练泥、拉坯、画坯、上釉、入窑

7
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,400
No one makes the whole piece alone.
没人能独自做完一件

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,700
The Ming book "Tiangong Kaiwu" wrote it down.
明代《天工开物》就记下了

9
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,000
An assembly line, centuries before factories.
早于工厂的流水线

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,600
★ Expert Tip: at Taoxichuan, watch young makers throw clay by hand.
内行提示：陶溪川能看年轻匠人手作

11
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,400
72 hands for one bowl — follow for the next city.
一只碗过手72次，关注下一座城
